{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The harness now constructs the prefix through bootstrap, election, and replication. A lagging peer then emits a vote request that advances the follower’s term while its append remains queued. The check will deliver both the old completion and the later HardState-only completion, isolating term validity from entry identity. MemoryStorage provides a controlled backend here; this does not test disk crash durability.\n"}}
